{"title":"G285 MC10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=G285_MC10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/f/c1f0a94ea8742b3593b3b394c54f3ad77a4b1de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left \\lceil {\\frac{3!+4!+5!+6!}{2+3+4+5+6}} \\right \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"154\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/89135b84ce4ab65534a21b1009c6c69749fa7467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 42\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 43\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 44\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 45\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=G285_MC10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/f/7bfe0054afbec4e333c121c13b64bfc82fc46a58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{6+24+120+720}{20} = \\frac{87}{2} = \\lceil 43.5 \\rceil \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 44}\\]\" width=\"383\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017225339\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensiv